# Scope: the npm workspace rooted here (MyssFormio, MyssWebclient,
# MyssAdminWebclient). MyssContent has its own package root and lockfile and
# does not read this file.
#
# typescript-eslint 8.71.1 declares a peer range of typescript <6.1.0, while the
# webclients are on typescript 7 (Renovate, 2026-10-14). Without this, neither
# `npm install` nor `npm ci` can resolve the tree. Remove it once
# typescript-eslint supports typescript 7, or the webclients move back to 6.0.
legacy-peer-deps=true
